text: ['({T}: Add {G} or {U}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)', "Alchemist's Greeting deals 4 damage to target creature.\nMadness {1}{R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)", 'All Rats have fear.\n{T}, Sacrifice a Rat: Create X 1/1 black Rat creature tokens, where X is the number of Rats you control.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\nSearch your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a permanent.\nExile target artifact, creature, or enchantment.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, if that player has no cards in hand, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.\nMadness {1}{B} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)", 'At the beginning of your end step, choose one —\n• You gain 1 life.\n• Return target creature card with mana value 1 from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control four or more creatures, transform Hanweir Militia Captain.', 'Battalion — Whenever Boros Elite and at least two other creatures attack, Boros Elite gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Bonded Construct can't attack alone.", 'Changeling\nWhen Faceless Agent enters the battlefield, seek a creature card of the most prevalent creature type in your library.', 'Choose one —\n• You gain 4 life.\n• Destroy target enchantment.\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nExile target attacking or blocking creature.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\nReturn X target creature cards with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.", 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.', 'Counter target spell.\nDraw a card.', 'Create a 1/1 green Snake creature token, a 2/2 green Wolf creature token, and a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'Create a 1/1 green Squirrel creature token.\nFlashback {1}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create a 2/2 blue Djinn Monk creature token with flying.\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Create two 1/1 colorless Sliver creature tokens.', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Cycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Deathtouch\nWhen Plaguecrafter's Familiar enters the battlefield, choose a creature card in your hand. It perpetually gains deathtouch.", "Deathtouch\nWhen Ruin Rat dies, exile target card from an opponent's graveyard.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWhen Roc Egg dies, create a 3/3 white Bird creature token with flying.", 'Delirium — This spell costs {2} less to cast if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard.\nDraw three cards.', 'Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Diregraf Colossus enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each Zombie card in your graveyard.\nWhenever you cast a Zombie spell, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Discard a card: Ravenous Bloodseeker gets +2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Discard a card: Transform Heir of Falkenrath. Activate only once each turn.', "Elusive Krasis can't be blocked.\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 as long as it's a Human. Otherwise, it can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -6/-0 and loses flying.', 'Enchant creature\nWhen Dragon Mantle enters the battlefield, draw a card.\nEnchanted creature has "{R}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\nNezumi Cutthroat can't block.", 'Fiery Temper deals 3 damage to any target.\nMadness {R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', 'First strike\nWhenever Reckless Racer becomes tapped, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.', 'Flash\nFlying\nWhen Restoration Angel enters the battlefield, you may exile target non-Angel creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under your control.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nWhen Breaching Hippocamp enters the battlefield, untap another target creature you control.', 'Flying', "Flying\nBattle Squadron's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.", 'Flying\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Flying\nManagorger Phoenix can't block.\nWhenever you cast a spell, if Managorger Phoenix is in your graveyard, put a flame counter on Managorger Phoenix for each {R} in that spell's mana cost. If Managorger Phoenix has five or more flame counters on it, return it to the battlefield and it perpetually gets +1/+1.", 'Flying\nNimbus Swimmer enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', "Flying\nWhen Kor Skyfisher enters the battlefield, return a permanent you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\nWhen Mentor of Evos Isle enters the battlefield, choose a creature card in your hand. It perpetually gains flying.', "Flying\nWhen Mulldrifter enters the battlefield, draw two cards.\nEvoke {2}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'Flying\nWhenever Sustainer of the Realm blocks, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhenever a Dragon you control becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, Thunderbreak Regent deals 3 damage to that player.', 'Flying\nWhenever a creature attacks, you may pay {3}. When you do, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.', 'Flying\n{1}{U}, Discard two cards: Return Stitchwing Skaab from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'Flying\n{2}{R}: Scion of Shiv perpetually gets +1/+0.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying, lifelink', 'Flying, vigilance\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Haste\nMadness {2}{R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', 'Haste\nWhen Reckless Ringleader enters the battlefield, choose a creature card in your hand. It perpetually gains haste.', 'Haste\n{T}, Discard a card: Draw a card.', 'If an effect would create one or more tokens under your control, it creates twice that many of those tokens instead.', 'If one or more +1/+1 counters would be put on a creature you control, that many plus one +1/+1 counters are put on it instead.', 'If you have no land cards in your hand, seek a land card and a nonland card. Otherwise, seek two nonland cards.', 'Insatiable Gorgers attacks each combat if able.\nMadness {3}{R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', 'Khalni Garden enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Khalni Garden enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token.\n{T}: Add {G}.', 'Lifelink\nMarkov Crusader has haste as long as you control another Vampire.', 'Lifelink\nWhen Leonin Sanctifier enters the battlefield, choose a creature card in your hand. It perpetually gains lifelink.', 'Lifelink\nWhenever you cycle another card, you may pay {1}{W}. If you do, return Benalish Partisan from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped and it perpetually gets +1/+0.\nCycling {1}{W}', 'Lifelink\n{2}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on each Vampire you control.', 'Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order. You may shuffle.\nDraw a card.', 'Menace\nWhen Goblin Dark-Dwellers enters the battlefield, you may cast target instant or sorcery card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\nDiscard a card, Sacrifice Insolent Neonate: Draw a card.", 'Ninjutsu {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Return an unblocked attacker you control to hand: Put this card onto the battlefield from your hand tapped and attacking.)\nWhenever Ninja of the Deep Hours deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.', 'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, Return an unblocked attacker you control to hand: Put this card onto the battlefield from your hand tapped and attacking.)\nWhenever Okiba-Gang Shinobi deals combat damage to a player, that player discards two cards.', "Ninjutsu {B} ({B}, Return an unblocked attacker you control to hand: Put this card onto the battlefield from your hand tapped and attacking.)\nWhenever Skullsnatcher deals combat damage to a player, exile up to two target cards from that player's graveyard.", "Other Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Outlast {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has first strike.', 'Outlast {W} ({W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has flying.', 'Outlast {W} ({W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has lifelink.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature, two +1/+1 counters on another target creature, and three +1/+1 counters on a third target creature.', 'Reach\nWhen Skyshroud Lookout enters the battlefield, seek an Elf card.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\nMadness {U} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)", "Sarkhan's Scorn deals damage equal to the number of turns you have begun to target creature or planeswalker.", 'Servant of the Scale enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.\nWhen Servant of the Scale dies, put X +1/+1 counters on target creature you control, where X is the number of +1/+1 counters on Servant of the Scale.', 'Sliver creatures you control get +0/+1.', 'Sliver creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Sliver creatures you control have "{T}: Add one mana of any color."', 'Sliver creatures you control have double strike. (They deal both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Sliver creatures you control have first strike. (They deal combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Sliver creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', "Sliver creatures you control have menace. (They can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Sliver creatures you control have vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause them to tap.)", 'Starting intensity 3\nStatic Discharge deals damage equal to its intensity to any target> Then cards you own named Static Discharge intensify by 1.', 'Tap target creature. That creature perpetually gains "This creature doesn\'t untap during your untap step" and "{8}: Untap this creature."', 'Tap up to two target creatures.\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature an opponent controls perpetually gets -1/-2.', "Target creature can't block this turn.\nDraw a card.", 'Target creature gains double strike until end of turn. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn.', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. When the creature you control wins the fight, draw a card.", "Target creature's base power perpetually becomes 0.", 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player creates X 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens, then up to one target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn for each Zombie that player controls.', 'Trample\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, you may discard a card. If you do, Furyblade Vampire gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', 'Trample\nEvolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', 'Trample\nMadness {2}{R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', 'Trample\nWhen Aetherstream Leopard enters the battlefield, you get {E} (an energy counter).\nWhenever Aetherstream Leopard attacks, you may pay {E}. If you do, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Vigilance, trample', 'When Blade Splicer enters the battlefield, create a 3/3 colorless Phyrexian Golem artifact creature token.\nGolems you control have first strike.', 'When Blisterstick Shaman enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Boneyard Aberration dies, exile it. If you do, conjure three cards named Reassembling Skeleton into your graveyard.', 'When Carrier Thrall dies, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Doomed Traveler dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'When Eyeblight Assassin enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Haunted Dead enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.\n{1}{B}, Discard two cards: Return Haunted Dead from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'When Ichor Wellspring enters the battlefield or is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Kuldotha Flamefiend enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice an artifact. If you do, Kuldotha Flamefiend deals 4 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'When Lumbering Lightshield enters the battlefield, target opponent reveals a nonland card at random from their hand. It perpetually gains "This spell costs {1} more to cast."', "When Manic Scribe enters the battlefield, each opponent mills three cards.\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, that player mills three cards.", 'When Manor Guardian dies, each player seeks a nonland card with mana value 2 or less.', 'When Rage Forger enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other Shaman creature you control.\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it attacks, you may have that creature deal 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'When Regal Force enters the battlefield, draw a card for each green creature you control.', 'When Sandsteppe Outcast enters the battlefield, choose one —\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on Sandsteppe Outcast.\n• Create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'When Shoreline Scout enters the battlefield, you may exile a Merfolk card or a land card from your hand. If you do, conjure a card named Tropical Island into your hand.\nAs long as another Merfolk or an Island entered the battlefield under your control this turn, Shoreline Scout gets +1/+0.', 'When Striped Bears enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "When Thalia's Lieutenant enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other Human you control.\nWhenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Thalia's Lieutenant.", 'When Treasure Keeper dies, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland card with mana value 3 or less. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost. Put all revealed cards not cast this way on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Veteran Charger enters the battlefield, choose a creature card in your hand. It perpetually gets +2/+2.', 'When Wingsteed Trainer enters the battlefield or attacks, conjure a card named Stormfront Pegasus into your hand.', 'Whenever Longtusk Stalker enters the battlefield or attacks, you get {E}.\nPay {E}{E}: Longtusk Stalker perpetually gets +1/+0. You may choose a creature card in your hand. If you do, that card perpetually gets +1/+0.', 'Whenever a Sliver creature you control becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter that spell or ability unless its controller pays {2}.', 'Whenever a Sliver you control attacks, defending player loses 1 life.', 'Whenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\nWhenever you sacrifice a Clue, create a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token.', 'Whenever another red creature enters the battlefield under your control, Foundry Street Denizen gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '[+1]: Conjure a card named Kraken Hatchling into your hand.\n[+1]: Untap target creature or land. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to and dealt by that permanent until your next turn.\n[−3]: You may sacrifice a Kraken. If you do, create an 8/8 blue Kraken creature token.', '[+1]: Dragon cards in your hand perpetually gain "This spell costs {1} less to cast," and "You may pay {X} rather than pay this spell\'s mana cost, where X is its mana value."\n[+1]: Conjure a card named Shivan Dragon into your hand.\n[−2]: Sarkhan, Wanderer to Shiv deals 3 damage to target creature.', '[+1]: Untap up to one target Elf. That Elf and a random Elf creature card in your hand perpetually get +1/+1.\n[−1]: Seek an Elf card.\n[−6]: Conjure a card named Regal Force onto the battlefield.', "[+1]: Until your next turn, whenever an opponent attacks you and/or planeswalkers you control, they discard a card. If they can't, they sacrifice an attacking creature.\n[−2]: Accept one of Davriel's offers, then accept one of Davriel's conditions.\n[−3]: Target creature an opponent controls perpetually gets -3/-3.", '[+1]: Up to one target creature\'s base power perpetually becomes equal to its toughness. It perpetually gains "This creature can attack as though it didn\'t have defender."\n[−2]: Conjure a card named Lumbering Lightshield onto the battlefield.\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "At the beginning of your end step, return target white creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. You gain life equal to its toughness."', '{1}{B}: Return Reassembling Skeleton from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{1}{B}: Target attacking Zombie gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it. If its toughness is 0 or less, it\'s still put into its owner\'s graveyard.)', '{1}{G}, Sacrifice a land: Create two 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens.\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice a land: Squirrel creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{1}{W}, Sacrifice Selfless Cathar: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{1}{W}, {T}, Discard a card: Create a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token.', '{2}, Pay 2 life: Choose one. Activate only once.\n• Subversive Acolyte becomes a Human Cleric. It gets +1/+1 and gains lifelink.\n• Subversive Acolyte becomes a Phyrexian. It gets +3/+2 and gains trample and "Whenever this creature is dealt damage, sacrifice that many permanents."', "{4}{U}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{B}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Facevaulter gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{R}, Sacrifice Implement of Combustion: It deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.\nWhen Implement of Combustion is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a Sliver spell.\n{5}, {T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Sliver creature token. Activate only if you control a Sliver.', '{U}, {T}: Conjure a random card from Tome of the Infinite\'s spellbook into your hand. It perpetually gains "You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast this spell."', "{X}, {T}, Discard a card: Create a token that's a copy of a random creature card with mana value X. Activate only as a sorcery."]
